 ensure that we buy  make and sell more  in britain and i think that the party in  batley and spend came together  under kia's leadership with kim as the  candidate it showed  everything that is best about the labour  party uh and  under kia's leadership and with kim in  parliament i think that we can  build on that success in batley and  spend going into the summer  then with our party conference and then  uh campaigning at the next general  election lightweight campaigns in batley  and spend  go on for more victories going forward  okay well you're not disagreeing with  with lord mendelson but you are  stressing the excellence of york  you're you're stressing the excellence  of your candidate  um under kier's leadership  we won in badly and spent okay will take  us into the next election  and i believe that that results in the  early hours of friday morning  is the start of more victories for labor  all right before we leave batman spend  you spoke of  the hatred and division being sowed  in that election campaign as did um  zakir  on friday morning who exactly was sowing  hatred and division  well i mean i was there on many  occasions  and i saw some of the behaviors of  george galloway  and his campaign uh and the  violence and aggression shown towards  both kim and other labour actors  there is no place for the sort of  behaviour that we saw in batley and  spain  in any election but especially in a  place  like battle and spring that has been  through so much in the last five years  or so and deserved  so much better than what they saw during  this by-election campaign and the people  of batman spain rejected that  and they voted for kim and kim is now  their mp and i know that kim would do  everything in  her power to bring the community  together as she has  over the last five years running schemes  like mooring common battery and spen  and i am so proud of kim but also  of the people of batley and spain thank  you for being so clear in pointing the  finger  